{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8f370b63fda503d7","name":"Entrenching Tool","source":{"id":"source:reference-8f370b63fda503d7","title":"Entrenching Tool","revision":26758,"timestamp":"2025-07-18T11:07:23Z","sha256":"204a8b0788d9f078b92ce981e75929c5acbec0811f421ec14b6204b186f0cbb0","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26758","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Entrenching%20Tool&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8f370b63fda503d7","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Used by soldiers for thousands of years, the Entrenching Tool is a durable, multipurpose tool that also can be an effective melee weapon. The Entrenching Tool can be configured as a short shovel, a pickaxe, or even a makeshift hammer. The Entrenching Tool is designed to be durable enough for combat, but it is not as balanced as a regular weapon. The wielder takes a -2 penalty to attack rolls (",{"tag":"a","children":["Improvised Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improvised_Weapons"}," normally impose a -5 penalty to attack rolls) and can choose to deal either Piercing or Slashing damage.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:cd7a4aafaae07eb3"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Small\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 50\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 1d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1 Kilogram\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Slashing or Piercing\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
